[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17461.27, "timestamp": "04:51:01", "text": "我查了一下这个全息直播装置是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17464.23, "timestamp": "04:51:04", "text": "以及所有的一切。我在一次偶然的机会中发现了Kiss"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17467.708, "timestamp": "04:51:07", "text": "首先是眼睛，我很享受我们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17470.708, "timestamp": "04:51:10", "text": "视频，我很喜欢，模特就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17473.43, "timestamp": "04:51:13", "text": "3D模型能否移动以及其表现力如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17475.83, "timestamp": "04:51:15", "text": "以及所有的一切。我当时就想，哇，这真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17478.23, "timestamp": "04:51:18", "text": "太酷了。就好像你不需要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17481.43, "timestamp": "04:51:21", "text": "超越外表，展现你的真面目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17483.99, "timestamp": "04:51:23", "text": "东西。这或许真的能帮到我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17487.67, "timestamp": "04:51:27", "text": "我的抱负是什么？我的抱负是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17490.15, "timestamp": "04:51:30", "text": "那段时间。所以我就说，是的，我可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17492.788, "timestamp": "04:51:32", "text": "调查一下。于是我开始看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17495.03, "timestamp": "04:51:35", "text": "她每天都会亲吻她的眼睛"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17496.041, "timestamp": "04:51:36", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "no way me also got introducted to vtubing bcuz of miku "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17498.788, "timestamp": "04:51:38", "text": "直播。然后他们上传了视频。然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17501.75, "timestamp": "04:51:41", "text": "然后这三个呃三个呃你什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17505.19, "timestamp": "04:51:45", "text": "叫它什么？ YouTube三大巨头。吻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17508.31, "timestamp": "04:51:48", "text": "眼睛里。呃，她叫什么名字来着？哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17510.868, "timestamp": "04:51:50", "text": "我的上帝。她是我最喜欢的角色之一。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17516.4, "time